---
import BioDemo from "../layouts/BioDemo.astro";
---

<BioDemo
	title="biomorphic ui — tree"
	material="tree"
	toggleStates="active,wall"
	toggleLabels="grow tree|clear tree"
>
	<h1>tree</h1>
	<p class="lead">
		Live space colonization (Runions): roots anchor on the box rim and
		branches grow toward scattered light. Separate trees share one tissue
		map plus a small cross-group <em>aura</em>, so neighbouring branches
		leave a crown-shyness gap instead of touching.
	</p>

	<section class="card sub" data-bio-group="card">
		<h2>Root box</h2>
		<p>
			Each element is its own tree. Branches thicken over time (da Vinci)
			and stop at a neighbour's box or branches.
		</p>
	</section>

	<div class="shapes">
		<div class="sub shape circle" data-bio-group="shapes" data-shape="circle">
			<span>circle</span>
		</div>
		<div
			class="sub shape star"
			data-bio-group="shapes"
			data-shape="star"
			data-points="5"
		>
			<span>star</span>
		</div>
		<div
			class="sub shape hex"
			data-bio-group="shapes"
			data-shape="polygon"
			data-sides="6"
		>
			<span>hexagon</span>
		</div>
	</div>

	<details class="reflow">
		<summary>group-relative reflow</summary>
		<div class="reflow-body">
			<p>
				Each box is its own group. Opening this panel grows the gap and
				slides the toggle below down as one piece. Once a group has settled,
				moving it just <em>translates</em> the finished shape — a jigsaw piece
				— instead of re-growing it, so neither counter moves.
			</p>
			<div class="status">
				re-seeds — shapes: <b data-reseed="shapes">0</b> · toggle:
				<b data-reseed="toggle">0</b>
			</div>
		</div>
	</details>

	<div class="row">
		<button
			class="btn sub"
			id="growthBtn"
			data-bio-group="toggle"
			data-bio-mode="active"
		>
			grow tree
		</button>
	</div>
</BioDemo>
